# Research Questions

## Primary Research Question

Where are Congolese professional footballers playing globally, and how
are they distributed by country, league, position, age, and club level?

## Initial Data Collection Question

Which Congolese players have been selected for the September 2026
DR Congo national-team call-up, and where were they playing at the time
of selection?

## Future Research Questions

- Which countries host the largest number of Congolese professional
  footballers?
- Which leagues are most represented?
- How are players distributed by position?
- How does the player distribution vary by age?
- How does the club distribution vary by competitive level?
- Which leagues and clubs are represented among national-team selections?
- How does the national-team player pool change across international
  windows?
